                            "description": "Romanticism Nature Project Directions:Â Â &#xA;Find a place in nature, go further than your backyard, put forth some effort.Â  Then choose one of the possibilities as a project:&#xA;*Write a descriptive journal entry or poem in the tradition of Wordsworth and his romantic friends you should include pictures and lengthy descriptions of the landscape and experience. (3 typed pages double spaced, not including photos)&#xA;*Create a podcast describing an experience in nature and its romantic impact upon you.Â  Again, this should be extensive.Â  Describe not only the landscape, but your feelings and experiences.Â  (3-5 minutes in length)&#xA;*Create an annotated photo journal in the form of a powerpoint potentially describing in detail a place or event and how they were romantically inspired by itâ€¦ (20 Slides)&#xA;*Create a personal documentary film exemplifying the ideas of the romantic experience of you in nature.Â  It should include a description of the landscape as well as your ideas and experiences in the romantic tradition. (3-5 minutes in length)&#xA;&#xA;*Got a better idea?Â  Run it by me and get approval.",
